<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Biology Education Expo (BEE) - UIN Syarif Hidayatullah Jakarta</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-yellow: #fef08a;       /* Kuning Background Utama (Soft Lemon) */
            --yellow-accent: #eab308;   /* Kuning Emas */
            --yellow-dark: #ca8a04;     /* Kuning Gelap untuk teks/border */
            --green-uin: #005a2b;       /* Hijau Khas UIN Jakarta */
            --green-dark: #00381a;
            --dark: #1e293b;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-yellow);
            color: var(--dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Top Notification Bar ala Event/OPTIKA */
        .top-bar {
            background: var(--green-dark);
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            padding: 10px 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .top-bar a {
            color: var(--yellow-accent);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Navbar */
        nav {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 5%;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(202, 138, 4, 0.15);
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--green-uin);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .logo-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--yellow-dark);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 25px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--dark);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--green-uin);
        }

        .btn-register {
            background: var(--green-uin);
            color: var(--white) !important;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 90, 43, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-register:hover {
            background: var(--yellow-dark);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            padding: 70px 5% 90px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 40px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #fde047, var(--bg-yellow));
        }

        .hero-text {
            flex: 1.2;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            background: var(--green-uin);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
            color: var(--green-dark);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: var(--yellow-dark);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #475569;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero-btns {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--green-uin);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0, 90, 43, 0.25);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: var(--green-dark);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: var(--white);
            color: var(--green-uin);
            border: 2px solid var(--green-uin);
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: var(--green-uin);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        /* Countdown Box ala OPTIKA */
        .countdown-box {
            flex: 0.8;
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            border: 3px solid var(--yellow-accent);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .countdown-box h3 {
            color: var(--green-uin);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .timer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .time-card {
            background: var(--bg-yellow);
            padding: 15px 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            min-width: 65px;
        }

        .time-card span {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--green-dark);
            display: block;
        }

        .time-card label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #64748b;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Section Global */
        .section {
            padding: 80px 5%;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--green-dark);
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: #64748b;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        /* Cabang Lomba (Competitions) */
        .comp-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .comp-card {
            background: var(--white);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 30px 25px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
            border-bottom: 5px solid var(--yellow-accent);
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }

        .comp-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(202, 138, 4, 0.2);
        }

        .comp-icon {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            background: var(--bg-yellow);
            color: var(--green-uin);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
        }

        .comp-card h3 {
            color: var(--green-dark);
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .comp-card p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .comp-link {
            color: var(--yellow-dark);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        /* Timeline / Alur Kegiatan */
        .timeline-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            border-radius: 25px;
            margin: 0 5%;
            padding: 50px 30px;
        }

        .timeline-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .timeline-item {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--green-uin);
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
        }

        .timeline-step {
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--yellow-dark);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .timeline-item h4 {
            color: var(--green-dark);
            margin: 5px 0;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        .timeline-date {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: var(--green-dark);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 50px 5% 20px;
            margin-top: 80px;
        }

        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .footer-col h4 {
            color: var(--yellow-accent);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .footer-col p, .footer-col li {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .footer-col ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .footer-col ul li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .footer-col a {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .footer-col a:hover {
            color: var(--yellow-accent);
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        /* Responsif */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .hero-btns {
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .countdown-box {
                width: 100%;
            }
            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="top-bar">
        <div><i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn"></i> Pendaftaran Gelombang 1 Biology Education Expo (BEE) Resmi Dibuka!</div>
        <div><a href="#panduan"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Unduh Guidebook</a></div>
    </div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#" class="logo">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-dna logo-icon"></i>
            <div>
                <span>BEE 2026</span>
                <span style="display:block; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;">Pendidikan Biologi - FITK UIN Jakarta</span>
            </div>
        </a>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#beranda">Beranda</a></li>
            <li><a href="#tentang">Tentang</a></li>
            <li><a href="#cabang-lomba">Cabang Lomba</a></li>
            <li><a href="#timeline">Jadwal</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
            <li><a href="#daftar" class="btn-register"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-signature"></i> Daftar Sekarang</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero" id="beranda">
        <div class="hero-text">
            <span class="hero-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-seedling"></i> National Biology Event</span>
            <h1>Biology Education <span>Expo 2026</span></h1>
            <p>Ajang eksplorasi potensi, kompetisi olimpiade biologi, karya tulis ilmiah, dan kreativitas media pembelajaran sains tingkat nasional.</p>
            <div class="hero-btns">
                <a href="#cabang-lomba" class="btn-primary">Pilih Cabang Lomba</a>
                <a href="#guidebook" class="btn-secondary">Buku Panduan</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="countdown-box">
            <h3><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> Batas Penutupan Gelombang 1</h3>
            <div class="timer">
                <div class="time-card">
                    <span id="days">14</span>
                    <label>Hari</label>
                </div>
                <div class="time-card">
                    <span id="hours">08</span>
                    <label>Jam</label>
                </div>
                <div class="time-card">
                    <span id="minutes">45</span>
                    <label>Menit</label>
                </div>
                <div class="time-card">
                    <span id="seconds">20</span>
                    <label>Detik</label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="cabang-lomba">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>Kategori & <span>Cabang Kompetisi</span></h2>
            <p>Pilih ajang kompetisi sesuai tingkat pendidikan dan minat Anda</p>
        </div>

        <div class="comp-grid">
            <div class="comp-card">
                <div class="comp-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-microscope"></i></div>
                <h3>Olimpiade Biologi</h3>
                <p>Uji kemampuan teoritis dan analisis biologi untuk jenjang SMA/MA sederajat se-Indonesia.</p>
                <a href="#" class="comp-link">Detail & Syarat <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>

            <div class="comp-card">
                <div class="comp-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-flask-vial"></i></div>
                <h3>Lomba Karya Tulis Ilmiah</h3>
                <p>Kompetisi riset inovatif dan solutif di bidang biologi dan lingkungan hidup untuk mahasiswa & siswa.</p>
                <a href="#" class="comp-link">Detail & Syarat <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>

            <div class="comp-card">
                <div class="comp-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-shapes"></i></div>
                <h3>Video Kreatif</h3>
                <p>Kreasi video Kreatif.</p>
                <a href="#" class="comp-link">Detail & Syarat <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>

            <div class="comp-card">
                <div class="comp-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera-retro"></i></div>
                <h3>Praktikum</h3>
                <p>Seputar Tema yang telah di tentukan.</p>
                <a href="#" class="comp-link">Detail & Syarat <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="timeline-section" id="timeline">
        <div class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <h2>Linimasa <span>Kegiatan</span></h2>
            <p>Catat tanggal penting dan jangan sampai terlewat</p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-grid">
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-step">Tahap 1</div>
                <h4>Registrasi Gel. 1</h4>
                <div class="timeline-date"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 1 - 20 September 2026</div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-step">Tahap 2</div>
                <h4>Technical Meeting</h4>
                <div class="timeline-date"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 28 September 2026</div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-step">Tahap 3</div>
                <h4>Babak Penyisihan</h4>
                <div class="timeline-date"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 5 Oktober 2026</div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-step">Tahap 4</div>
                <h4>Grand Final & Expo</h4>
                <div class="timeline-date"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 15 Oktober 2026</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-grid">
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Biology Education Expo</h4>
                <p>Himpunan Mahasiswa Program Studi Pendidikan Biologi (HMPS PBIO)<br>
                Fakultas Ilmu Tarbiyah dan Keguruan (FITK)<br>
                UIN Syarif Hidayatullah Jakarta</p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Narahubung (CP)</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i> Kak Sarah (Olimpiade): 0812-3456-7890</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i> Kak Rizky (LKTI): 0898-7654-3210</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> bee.pbio@uinjkt.ac.id</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Media Sosial</h4>
                <p>Dapatkan pembaruan info lomba di:</p>
                <div style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 10px; display: flex; gap: 15px;">
                    <a href="#"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fa-brands fa-tiktok"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-bottom">
            &copy; 2026 Biology Education Expo - UIN Syarif Hidayatullah Jakarta.
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>